{"id":"wb-7-1090","name":"九头马民居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"九头马民居","text":"九头马民居，位于中华人民共和国福建省福州市长乐区鹤上镇岐阳村，是一座清代民居群。该民居东西和南北均长120米，公分为五列房屋，四周围以6米高的围墙。2013年，九头马民居入列全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%9D%E5%A4%B4%E9%A9%AC%E6%B0%91%E5%B1%85","revisionId":88055892,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88055892","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/514a191d4de6a69e2b5d86f5.jpg","title":"九头马民居1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B9%9D%E5%A4%B4%E9%A9%AC%E6%B0%91%E5%B1%851.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/%E4%B9%9D%E5%A4%B4%E9%A9%AC%E6%B0%91%E5%B1%851.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​九头马民居正门","width":320,"height":237}}